# UI theming & typography

Read `packages/ui/docs/THEMES.md` before adding colors to components.
Read `packages/ui/docs/TYPOGRAPHY.md` before changing fonts or text styles.

## Theme rules

- **Colors:** `var(--lf-*)` from `src/theme/themes.css` only — no `#hex` in component `styles`
- **Buttons:** `.lf-btn`, `.lf-btn--ghost`, `.lf-btn--icon` from `components.css`
- **Inputs:** `.lf-input`, `.lf-textarea` + `.lf-text-body`
- **Theme API:** `ThemeService` — do not set `data-theme` on `<html>` manually
- **Checklist:** complete `THEMES.md` new-component checklist; test dark + light

## Typography rules

- **Tokens:** `src/theme/tokens.css` — font sizes/weights/families only
- **Classes:** `.lf-text-*` from `typography.css` — no raw `font-size: Npx`
- **Headings:** `h1` toolbar · `h2` panel titles · canvas node labels are `span`
- **Muted:** `.lf-text-caption--muted` or `var(--lf-text-muted)`

## Files

- `src/theme/themes.css` — color variables (dark default, light override)
- `src/theme/tokens.css` — typography + spacing tokens
- `src/theme/typography.css` — semantic text utilities
- `src/theme/components.css` — buttons and inputs
- `docs/THEMES.md` — full guide + checklist
- `docs/TYPOGRAPHY.md` — font scale and headings
